This repository contains the code for "Replay Before You Reply: Second-Look
Prompting for Unified Multimodal Encoding".

It is derived from VLMEvalKit (https://github.com/open-compass/VLMEvalKit),
copyright the VLMEvalKit authors and licensed under the Apache License,
Version 2.0. The base is upstream commit
00804217f868058f871f5ff252a7b9623c3475d9 (2026-03-05). LICENSE is the
unmodified upstream license.

Changes relative to that commit:
- replay model wrappers (image-question repetition and its controls) for
  Qwen2.5-VL, Qwen3.5/Qwen3.8, MiniCPM-V/o 4.5, Gemma-3 and Gemma-4,
  with minimal per-family model registries (vlmeval/config_*_minimal.py);
- a declarative matrix runner and result collector (scripts/run_benchmark.sh,
  vlmeval/cli/);
- attention-intervention and scratchpad probes (vlmeval/probes/);
- latency measurement (scripts/latency_test.py, tools/);
- the experiment configurations used in the paper (configs/paper/);
- removal of model implementations, scripts and configurations that these
  experiments do not use.
